jobs.description:
Why SOFICO?

At SOFICO
, we’re shaping the future of mobility - and we’re doing it together. Our software, Miles, is a leading platform that enables companies worldwide to manage their leasing, fleet, and mobility operations in one integrated system. Every day, we help our customers work smarter, more efficiently, and stay ahead in a rapidly evolving industry.

Behind that impact is a close-knit, international team that values collaboration, ownership, and continuous growth. We move forward with ambition but stay grounded in a culture where people support each other and take pride in what they build.

From our ofice in Porto
, we are expanding our team with multiple Platform Engineers
. In this role, you will design and automate cloud-native environments using Kubernetes
, Azure
, Terraform
, and Ansible
to support global automotive leaders. Additionally, you will drive infrastructure modernization and ensure high system reliability through advanced monitoring.

What you’ll do...

Build environments and microservices using Kubernetes, Azure, and on-premise infrastructure;
Utilize Terraform, Ansible, and GitOps workflows;
Maintain global environments using OpsGenie, Prometheus, Grafana, FluentBit, and Loki;
Help customers and internal Sofico teams solve complex technical challenges;
Transform legacy components into scalable, cloud-native solutions;
Mentor peers and contribute to engineering standards across the company.

What you bring...

Proven experience with Kubernetes, Helm, Linux, and a major cloud provider (preferably Azure or AWS);
Familiarity with Oracle/MS SQL and core networking concepts (DNS, firewalls);
Fluency in English with the ability to explain technical topics to non-technical audiences;
Comfort working directly with customers, including joining customer calls, asking the right questions, and resolving issues.

What's In It For You

Competitive salary;
Daily meal allowance per working day;
Fully covered private health insurance, so you can focus on what matters most;
Hybrid working and flexible hours, giving you the freedom to shape your workday;
A modern co-working space offering a comfortable working environment;
From day one, you’ll be supported through a structured onboarding program, with guidance from a dedicated coach to help you get up to speed and grow in your role;
And because strong teams go beyond day-to-day work, we regularly create opportunities to connect - from casual drinks to team activities and company-wide events.

Ready to make an impact in the world of mobility? Join SOFICO and let’s shape what’s next together!

